Subject: [PATCH 213/488] soh: rename D_80AB431C -> sSpiritMedallionCs

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: CutsceneData script installed into csCtx.segment by EnNb_SetupChamberCsImpl, the chamberCutsceneNum == 3 branch that awards ITEM_MEDALLION_SPIRIT.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb_cutscene_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c               | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb_cutscene_data.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Nb/z_en_nb.c
